WEBVTT

00:16:26.774 --> 00:16:30.270
but there is no objective
dictionary authority out there

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:34.043
that is the final arbiter about what words mean.

00:16:34.043 --> 00:16:36.556
If a community of speakers is using a word

00:16:36.556 --> 00:16:40.152
and knows what it means, it's real.

00:16:40.152 --> 00:16:41.520
That word might be slangy,

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.162
that word might be informal,

00:16:43.162 --> 00:16:45.067
that word might be a word that you think

00:16:45.067 --> 00:16:47.524
is illogical or unnecessary,

00:16:47.524 --> 00:16:50.075
but that word that we're using,

00:16:50.075 --> 00:16:52.433
that word is real.

00:16:52.433 --> 00:16:54.774
Thank you.

00:16:54.774 --> 00:16:56.453
(Applause)